  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>We have,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>S</mi><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>:</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8660;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>For&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi><mn>1</mn><mo>:</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>If</mtext><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>is</mtext><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>F</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>is</mtext><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>T</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>is</mtext><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>F</mi><mo>&#160;</mo></math>, then</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8801;</mo><mi>F</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8801;</mo><mi>T</mi></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8660;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8801;</mo><mi>F</mi></math></p><p>then&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>F</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>F</mi><mo>&#8801;</mo><mi>F</mi></math></p><p>i.e.&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;is not a tautology</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>S</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>:</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8660;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8744;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>:&#160;&#160;</mo><mi>If</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>is</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>T</mi><mo>,&#160;</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>is</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>F</mi><mo>,&#160;</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>is</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>F</mi><mo>&#160;</mo></math>, then</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8801;</mo><mi>F</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8744;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8801;</mo><mi>T</mi></math></p><p>then&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8660;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8744;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8801;</mo><mi>F</mi></math></p><p>i.e.&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mn>2</mn></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;not a tautology</p>"
  }
